    {
      "text": "Ye Lui Sang, empowered by Immortal Gu and with rank five peak stage fire path strength, suppressed the heroes, swept through the last obstacle, and succeeded in dominating Du Jiao region. Just as Ye Lui army spreads outward, an alliance of seven armies pincer attacks it and puts Ye Lui army in a perilous situation.",
